For support, please [url=https://steamcommunity.com:/linkfilter/?url=https://github.com/hmlendea/imperator-latinised-english/issues]submit an issue[/url] on [url=https://steamcommunity.com:/linkfilter/?url=https://github.com/hmlendea/imperator-latinised-english]GitHub[/url]. None of the other channels are actively monitored, which may result in delayed responses.

